      "markdown": "## Example 1\n\n(a) If  $ f(x) = xe^{x} $, find  $ f'(x) $.\n\n(b) Find the nth derivative,  $ f^{(n)}(x) $.\n\nSolution:\n\n(a) By the Product Rule, we have\n\n $$ \\begin{aligned}f^{\\prime}(x)&=\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(xe^{x}\\right)&\\\\&=x\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(e^{x}\\right)+e^{x}\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(x\\right)\\\\ &\\\\&=xe^{x}+e^{x}\\cdot1=(x+1)e^{x}\\\\ \\end{aligned} $$ ",
